                <head ana="#head_untitled-missing-head-in-printed-volume">[Untitled]</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Headquarters Department of
                            Texas</hi>, <hi rendition="#italic">Galveston,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1866-02-05"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >February</hi> 5, 1866.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>Respectfully forwarded to headquarters military division of the gulf, for
                    consideration, in connection with previous papers relative to the same
                    matter.</p>
                <p>In absence of the major general commanding.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>E. H. WHITTLESEY, <hi rendition="#italic">Brevet Colonel and Assistant
                            Adjutant General.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
